[en.DECISION_C01_C12_LOYALTY_INVESTIGATION]
Secret Investigation In Rock Farm

[en.DECISION_C01_C12_LOYALTY_INVESTIGATION_desc]
Although the Rock Farm is a de jure part of the Equestria Empire, Cozy Glow feels that the Empire has no actual control over the Rock Farm. She decides to send a secret investigation team to the Rock Farm to find out what is going on there.

[zh.DECISION_C01_C12_LOYALTY_INVESTIGATION]
秘密调查采石农场

[zh.DECISION_C01_C12_LOYALTY_INVESTIGATION_desc]
即使采石农场是小马利亚帝国的正式一部分，和煦光流觉得帝国对采石农场没有实际控制。她决定派遣一支秘密调查队伍前往采石农场，以查明那里发生了什么。
